    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a darkened arctic tundra, you follow the life of Jupyter, a humanoid axolotl-like creature that had to say goodbye to their partner as they chased their dreams of a better life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Jupyter follows in the steps of their partner through the cold, barren wastelands, they discover hearths that they used along the way. At each of these hearths, a note was left detailing their partner\u2019s journey, their hopes, and the struggles they faced leaving the familiar behind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the frozen tundra, retrace your partner\u2019s steps, and rekindle your connection to another\u2019s soul.\u00a0</p>",
